CCTPBridgeModule_Ownership
├── transferOwnership
│   ├── when caller is not the owner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when caller is the owner
│   │   ├── it should set the pending owner
│   │   ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted
│   │   └── it should not change the current owner yet
│   ├── when transferring to zero address (cancel)
│   │   ├── it should set pendingOwner to zero
│   │   ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferStarted with zero address
│   │   └── it should prevent the cancelled pending owner from accepting
│   ├── when replacing a pending transfer
│   │   ├── it should overwrite the previous pending owner
│   │   └── the replaced pending owner should not be able to accept
│   └── when transferring to self
│       └── it should allow owner to transfer to themselves
├── acceptOwnership
│   ├── when caller is not the pending owner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when no pending transfer exists
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when old owner tries to accept
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when caller is the pending owner
│   │   ├── it should transfer ownership to the new owner
│   │   ├── it should clear the pending owner
│   │   ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferred
│   │   ├── it should allow new owner to call onlyOwner functions
│   │   └── it should not affect permissionless execute functionality
│   └── when old owner calls onlyOwner after transfer
│       └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── renounceOwnership
│   ├── when caller is not the owner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when caller is the owner
│   │   ├── it should set owner to zero address
│   │   ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferred to zero address
│   │   ├── it should block setDomainConfig
│   │   ├── it should block removeDomainConfig
│   │   └── it should block transferOwnership
│   └── when renouncing with a pending transfer
│       └── it should clear the pending owner
├── pendingOwner
│   ├── when no transfer is pending
│   │   └── it should return zero address
│   └── when a transfer is pending
│       └── it should return the pending owner address
└── full lifecycle
    └── transfer → accept → new owner transfers again → second accept
        └── it should complete two consecutive ownership cycles
